# A lap in a race without weapons (spec M5): pause.scenario's way into the race with the test game
# switched to no weapons, the car driven a whole lap (--drive), the HUD's clock and then the lap's
# time, TAB sliding the status bar away (the small board showing the lap's time) and back. A shot
# every second, then every 100 ms; run with --no-ai --drive.
